          "worked": "Label the rows with spinner outcomes $1,2,3$ and columns with die outcomes $1,2,3,4,5,6$. Each cell contains the sum of its row and column labels. The completed array has $18$ equally likely outcomes; repeated scores occupy separate cells.",
