              "worked": "The three rows contain $2,3,4$ scores greater than $5$, giving $9$ favourable cells.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{score}>5)&=\\frac{9}{18}\\\\P(\\text{score}>5)&=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
