              "worked": "Each row contains $3$ odd scores, giving $9$ favourable cells.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{odd score})&=\\frac{9}{18}\\\\P(\\text{odd score})&=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
